// Generated taped pullbacks have nonthrowing function types. No Swift source
// reproducer is known for these throwing callbacks invoked with [nothrow].
// Keep them opaque, including a throwing outer adapter over a nonthrowing root,
// while specializing the independent nonthrowing callback in the same payload.

